\f2\u10022?\f1  You are correct; I needed to verify this myself. Upon inspecting the directory\f0\rtlch\lang1025\par
  \f1\ltrch\lang1033 E:\\questionretrieval\\new-q-bank\\TAMS\\app\\schooldemo12\\apps\\online-exam, I found\f0\rtlch\lang1025\par
